---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '签证和入境规则——中国入门指南';
const description = '2026年访问中国免签证入境、240小时过境和旅游签证指南。更新于2026年6月。';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <a href="/zh/prepare/" class="text-sm text-brand-600 hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-1 mb-4">← 准备</a>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 leading-tight mb-4">签证和入境规则</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-500">关于2026年合法顺利进入中国，你需要知道的一切。</p>
    </header>

    <!-- Article List -->
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <!-- Article 1 -->
      <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/visa-guide/" class="block group">
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-brand-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-brand-600 bg-brand-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">指南</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">阅读6分钟</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors mb-2">2026年中国签证类型指南：您需要哪种签证？</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">进入中国比几年前更容易。比较免签证入境、240小时过境和旅游签证选项，找出适合您旅行的选项。</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium">阅读更多→</p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Article 2 -->
      <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/visa-free/" class="block group">
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-brand-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-brand-600 bg-brand-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">参考</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">阅读5分钟</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors mb-2">中国免签证国家名单（2026年）</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">检查你的国家是否有资格免签证进入中国。包括所有55个以上国家、逗留限制和入境要求。</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium">Read more →</p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Article 3 -->
      <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/transit-240/" class="block group">
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-brand-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-brand-600 bg-brand-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">GUIDE</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">阅读7分钟</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors mb-2">中国240小时免签证过境详解</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">在过境到第三国期间，无需签证在中国停留最多10天。资格、港口和允许的活动。</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium">Read more →</p>
        </div>

      <!-- Article 4 -->
      <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/apply-l-visa/" class="block group">
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-brand-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-brand-600 bg-brand-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">GUIDE</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">阅读8分钟</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors mb-2">如何申请2026年中国旅游签证（L型）：分步指南</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">L型旅游签证申请人的完整演练。COVA在线表格、所需文件、预约、处理时间以及签证中心的预期。</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium">Read more →</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="mt-12 bg-brand-50 border border-brand-100 rounded-2xl p-6 not-prose">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">快速回答</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">大多数旅客现在可以免签证（30天）进入中国，使用240小时过境政策，或申请标准旅游签证。查看上面的文章，找出适合您情况的选项。</p>
      <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/visa-guide/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium hover:underline">从签证指南开始→</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
